{"data": [{"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-08-05T15:23:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2085023811141820894"], "id": "2085023811141820894", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1550583309708808193", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 30405, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2085022729674064326", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "这个还能制造一些期待感\n前提是，你的确期待和这个人做爱，或者，对做爱这件事真心想要\n\n人有时在知道可能会发生什么的时候，第一反应，才是真实的想法，是期待，还是抗拒，或者反感厌恶", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2085023811141820894"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-08-05T15:18:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2085022602876043384", "2085022729674064326"], "id": "2085022729674064326", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 28, "impression_count": 93561, "like_count": 123, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 30, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "有些性爱建议是：如果太忙，可以把性爱时间放进日程里\n\n这个建议，我觉得不是对谁都有效的，比如说我更喜欢随性一些的性\n\n如果跟我说，我们晚上十一点到十二点期间做爱，我大概率就不想做了\n\n相反，对于一些喜欢规则纪律秩序感的人来说，提前预知具体时间，反而会有一种安全感", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2085022729674064326"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-08-02T19:13:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2083994671538159697"], "id": "2083994671538159697", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 130, "impression_count": 115310, "like_count": 346, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 77, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "女生提升快感💖小技巧\n找用力撒尿+推感觉，阴部有向外打开的感觉（也有女生是反向缩紧，总之找发力感\n\n发力本质是盆底肌收缩/放松，能增强流向生殖器区域的血液，从而增加性快感，简单说，让阴部充血，从而更敏感\n\n有人是靠夹腿/夹臀来达到这个感觉\n可以时不时用，但别过度依赖这个技巧哈", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2083994671538159697"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-07-30T14:14:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2082832085845234146"], "id": "2082832085845234146", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1550583309708808193", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 29392, "like_count": 57, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2082831447979598231", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "做爱的确会给人一种亲密感，尤其做完放松一下，说点平时不说的话\n\n但是这种亲密来得太快，你不需要真正了解对方就能发生\n\n所以只有性的关系下，两个人会同时有很强的亲密感受+很少的实际了解\n\n真想发展成恋人的时候可能才会发现，那种亲密和熟悉感，其实只停留在身体层面", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2082832085845234146"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-07-30T14:11:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2082831447979598231"], "id": "2082831447979598231", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 48, "impression_count": 87052, "like_count": 171, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 25, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "大部分情况下🌟\n炮友/床伴是不会成为恋人的\n\n不是完全不行，而是需要双方都能跳出传统婚恋脚本+追求的关系状态一致\n\n从性伴侣过渡到恋人，是需要推翻一套已经运行很久的「不问各自生活」、「不管对方情绪」的默认规则\n\n性的亲密无法替代，情感的亲密", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2082831447979598231"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-07-29T14:20:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2082471050948862293", "2082471251604279706"], "id": "2082471251604279706", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 33, "impression_count": 75876, "like_count": 95, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 70, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "不少找我做性咨询的人，问题不在 sex 本身，是把 sex 当成了爱、价值、归属的指标（但其实不是）\n\n一次没唤起 = Ta 不爱我/我对 ta 没感觉；不想做 = 我不够好/ta 不喜欢我了\n\n性欲不匹配 = 我们不合适\n\n因为被在乎的证据没有办法在别处确认，只好放到床上，而性其实给不出这些答案，它不负责这些", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2082471251604279706"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-07-25T17:52:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2081075195977015441"], "id": "2081075195977015441", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1550583309708808193", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 28457, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2081022457561886911", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "补充一下\n也有人慰时的性唤起机制 vs 性爱时的性唤起，是不一样的\n\n比如，自慰时可以先唤起心理再唤起生理，但到了做爱的时候反而需要先有生理刺激", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2081075195977015441"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-07-25T14:23:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2081017102098399273", "2081022457561886911"], "id": "2081022457561886911", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 125, "impression_count": 90326, "like_count": 116, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 18, "retweet_count": 17}, "text": "女生性唤起·究竟是什么感觉？\n给你一个「最直白最不绕弯子」的参考🤗\n\n要分成生理唤起+心理唤起\n它们不是同步发生的，而是有先后顺序\n\n https://t.co/6OyhHOLovo", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2081022457561886911"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-07-23T05:11:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2080158800082796807"], "id": "2080158800082796807", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 58498, "like_count": 52, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 107, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "哎，宝子们，有些玩具真的量力而行啊，它们是工具，需要使用说明\n\n但如果你对自己的生理结构、性知识缺乏了解，很容易用得不对，反而伤害自己（尿路感染、漏尿、膀胱功能紊乱…）\n\n🥲有时回后台私信看到大家说的各种问题，真的会很心疼😣", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2080158800082796807"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-07-22T16:28:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2079965187231076532", "2079965293112148064", "2079965427736653906", "2079966915905138900"], "id": "2079966915905138900", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 36, "impression_count": 73182, "like_count": 73, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 91, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "我发现不少人对【性唤起】这件事很模糊，核心是不知道这是什么样，是什么感觉\n\n🧐也让我意识到了一个问题——\n\n我们的情绪感受教育，非常稀缺（比如愤怒和委屈的区别都分不清）\n\n而性唤起需要的——感受教育是零\n\n没有人告诉你唤起时身体会有什么信号、它和紧张/焦虑的体感有多相似", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2079966915905138900"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-07-22T16:13:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2079962948588454030"], "id": "2079962948588454030", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1550583309708808193", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 36084, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2079934944931909924", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "也有其他原因，比如\n\n- 手法太粗或太干（没有润滑）\n- 触碰的位置不对（碰到的是包皮不是阴蒂本身）\n- 心理上有压力或分心（甚至创伤）\n\n但唤起不足是最普遍、也最容易被忽略的一个原因", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2079962948588454030"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-07-22T14:21:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2079934944931909924"], "id": "2079934944931909924", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 145, "impression_count": 220209, "like_count": 382, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 225, "retweet_count": 15}, "text": "为什么阴蒂没感觉🌟\n阴蒂需要性唤起——在没有唤起的状态下⬇️\n\n阴蒂体没有充血、被包皮完全覆盖、神经末梢的反应阈值很高\n\n这个时候直接触碰它，感受就是单纯的物理摩擦，像在摸一块没有神经的皮肤，没有快感，甚至有点麻或者不舒服", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2079934944931909924"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-07-20T15:39:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2079229818307022860"], "id": "2079229818307022860", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1550583309708808193", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 27738, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2078876548396974199", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "问了客服，社群功能在今年 5 月被 X 关闭了，所以现在无法创建新社群🥲\n我可能会考虑别的方式/平台 https://t.co/em5CRERo0A", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2079229818307022860"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-07-19T16:16:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2078876548396974199"], "id": "2078876548396974199", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 62187, "like_count": 16, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 29, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我在考虑要不要开个X社群\n因为现在plq的机器人实在太多了\n——\n但目前没找到开社群的按钮😅", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2078876548396974199"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-07-19T14:02:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2078842952827216377"], "id": "2078842952827216377", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1550583309708808193", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 29433, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2078840700251103621", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "补充说明⬇️\n比起来回抽送摩擦，顶压前壁更容易出感觉——是因为同时触压到了三个部分\n\n尿道的组织、阴蒂内部组织、阴道壁被牵拉的感觉\n\n但理论≠实践，比如具体在哪、往哪个角度顶、唤起到什么程度，怎么样不疼、压住之后怎么做，女生自慰课里有详细分步指导https://t.co/74K3cPm53t", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2078842952827216377"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-07-19T13:53:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2078840700251103621"], "id": "2078840700251103621", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 131, "impression_count": 144531, "like_count": 321, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 99, "retweet_count": 15}, "text": "从女生阴道-阴蒂的生理构造来说，入体的玩具，更适合停留+顶压\n\n也就是说⬇️\n入体玩具有点弧度，有一点硬度，顶住+按压阴道前壁，会更容易找到感觉\n\n靠抽送去摩擦阴道壁，不是主要快感来源——少数情况是借用玩具的粗度达到挤压效果 or 长度能触达宫颈附近\n（很多人这里会疼/有感觉，主要和性唤起有关）", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2078840700251103621"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-07-19T03:55:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2078690263757680962"], "id": "2078690263757680962", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1550583309708808193", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 29254, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2050035803510759765", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2071242429953462701", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "性爱人格测试⬇️ https://t.co/uKHcwNt3NY", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2078690263757680962"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-07-17T14:56:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2078131817110962268"], "id": "2078131817110962268", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 98, "impression_count": 147159, "like_count": 262, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 134, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "女生的性唤起🌟\n不是湿了，就意味着准备好了\n湿，不可以作为判断性唤起的唯一标准\n\n很多人找我咨询性问题会这么说⬇️\n前戏做了，湿了，然后直接到做的过程，什么姿势，动了多久，哪里不舒服，哪里疼\n\n问我为什么不舒服，是尺寸不行，阴茎朝向问题，还是动的不对\n\n基本都是前戏问题，是性唤起不够", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2078131817110962268"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-07-16T13:07:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2077741908718219383"], "id": "2077741908718219383", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1550583309708808193", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 34818, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2077412082530574606", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "补充一下⬇️\n如何知道自己哪里疼、哪里舒服\n其实，靠他人和你试是很慢的且不太可靠，最快的办法是自己先摸清楚自己的身体——\n\n哪个角度舒服、需要多少润滑、什么节奏合适，自己心里有数，再引导对方，体验会更好\n\n这些都写在我的自慰课里，一步一步教你👇\nhttps://t.co/74K3cPm53t", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2077741908718219383"}], "includes": {"tweets": [{"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-08-05T15:18:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2085022602876043384", "2085022729674064326"], "id": "2085022729674064326", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 28, "impression_count": 93561, "like_count": 123, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 30, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "有些性爱建议是：如果太忙，可以把性爱时间放进日程里\n\n这个建议，我觉得不是对谁都有效的，比如说我更喜欢随性一些的性\n\n如果跟我说，我们晚上十一点到十二点期间做爱，我大概率就不想做了\n\n相反，对于一些喜欢规则纪律秩序感的人来说，提前预知具体时间，反而会有一种安全感"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-07-30T14:11:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2082831447979598231"], "id": "2082831447979598231", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 48, "impression_count": 87052, "like_count": 171, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 25, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "大部分情况下🌟\n炮友/床伴是不会成为恋人的\n\n不是完全不行，而是需要双方都能跳出传统婚恋脚本+追求的关系状态一致\n\n从性伴侣过渡到恋人，是需要推翻一套已经运行很久的「不问各自生活」、「不管对方情绪」的默认规则\n\n性的亲密无法替代，情感的亲密"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-07-25T14:23:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2081017102098399273", "2081022457561886911"], "id": "208102245756